@host = http://localhost:5098

### Create — 201, response includes id + version
POST {{host}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy milk",
  "slug": "buy-milk"
}

### Create again with the same slug — 409 UniqueKeyViolation
POST {{host}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy milk again",
  "slug": "buy-milk"
}

### Load — replace <id> with an id from the create response
GET {{host}}/todos/<id>

### Complete — SetQ(Done, true) + IncrementQ(TouchCount, 1) in one Patch call
POST {{host}}/todos/<id>/complete

### Load a missing id — 404 DocumentNotFound
GET {{host}}/todos/does-not-exist
